<title>UK: Banco Bandeirantes sets $100 million Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Banco Bandeirantes sets $100 million Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured bond was announced by lead manager WestMerchant.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BANDEIRANTES SA</p>
<p> AMT	  $100 MLN  COUPON    *10.00     MATURITY   *12.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.9746   PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    99.9746   SPREAD    **+425 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO CALL AND PUT AT PAR AFTER THREE YEARS.</p>
<p>		ALSO CALL AND PUT AT PAR AFTER FIVE YEARS.</p>
<p>	     *STEPS UP TO 10.25 PCT AFTER THREE YEARS.</p>
<p>		THEN TO 10.50 PCT AFTER FIVE YEARS.</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	BANCO BANDEIRANTES IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
